      "title": "mein, mein, meine",
      "practice": "choose",
      "heroTitle": "The person gives the stem, ein gives the ending",
      "heroImage": "clipboard",
      "story": [
        "The stem follows the owner: <b>mein, dein, sein, ihr, unser, euer, ihr, Ihr</b>.",
        "The ending follows <b>ein</b>. Nominative: mein Zimmer, meine Akte. Accusative masculine: meinen Patienten. Dative masculine: meinem Patienten.",
        "<b>euer</b> drops one e when an ending is added: eure Station. Formal <b>Ihr</b> is written with a capital."
      ],
      "questionRule": "Name the owner first, then the case. untersuchen = accusative. helfen = dative.",
